            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.iiif.json/note/4",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Enter the full destination address</h3><p>Enter the complete https:// or http:// address for the menu, agenda, form or other page. Check that it opens for the intended audience.</p><p>The destination is correct.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.html#step-4\">Follow this step in Display a Website QR Code on TV for Menus, Agendas and Feedback</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.iiif.json/note/5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Add a caption and choose Show now</h3><p>Use a caption that explains the result, such as View today&#x27;s agenda or Tell us how we did. Show the code on the display.</p><p>Visitors know why they should scan.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.html#step-5\">Follow this step in Display a Website QR Code on TV for Menus, Agendas and Feedback</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.iiif.json/note/6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Test from the audience position</h3><p>Scan the displayed code with a separate phone. Confirm that it opens the intended page and the useful information is accessible.</p><p>The code leads to the right next action.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-website-qr-code-on-tv.html#step-6\">Follow this step in Display a Website QR Code on TV for Menus, Agendas and Feedback</a></p>"
